Daśaratha enters to announce crowning --- Daśaratha finds Kaikēyī on ground --- Daśaratha offers physicians and every favour --- Kaikēyī withholds wish until promised --- Daśaratha swears and offers his heart --- Kaikēyī invokes gods as witnesses --- Kaikēyī demands Bharata anointed with prepared rites --- Kaikēyī demands Rāma's fourteen-year Daṇḍaka bark-clad exile --- Daśaratha faints and reviles family destroyer --- Daśaratha begs touching her feet
